<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-songshu" book-id="b-songshu-092" chapter-id="c-songshu-092-wangxinzhi" source-id="s-songshu-092-wangxinzhi-ws2195614">
  <p id="c-songshu-092-wangxinzhi:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-songshu-092-wangxinzhi:p001:m0000" ref="bd2_8y8_397">王歆之</persName>字<persName id="c-songshu-092-wangxinzhi:p001:m0004" ref="bd2_8y8_397">叔道</persName>，河東人也。曾祖<persName id="c-songshu-092-wangxinzhi:p001:m0014" ref="dhx_wp0_d3a">愆期</persName>，有名晉世，官至南蠻校尉。祖<persName id="c-songshu-092-wangxinzhi:p001:m0030" ref="5kj_oof_v0t">尋之</persName>，光祿大夫。父<persName id="c-songshu-092-wangxinzhi:p001:m0039" ref="7xf_6fy_qh7">肇之</persName>，豫章公相。</p>
  <p id="c-songshu-092-wangxinzhi:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-songshu-092-wangxinzhi:p002:m0000" ref="bd2_8y8_397">歆之</persName>被遇於<persName id="c-songshu-092-wangxinzhi:p002:m0005" ref="3bh_k4m_fg4">太祖</persName>，歷顯官左民尚書，光祿大夫，卒官。</p>
</text>
